  "releaseNotes": "Added\nSqlQuery.ExecuteRowAsync() — executes the query and returns the first row as a DataRow, or null if the query returns no rows. Reads with CommandBehavior.SingleRow.\nSqlQuery.ExecuteSingleAsync<T>(Func<DataRow, T> map) — executes the query and maps the first row to T with the supplied mapper. Returns null if the query returns no rows. T must be a reference type.",
